{"id":1745636,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:40.360Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745636,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Mimpi Sabrina","overview":"# Translation  The story tells of a love affair between two different social classes—between Sabrina, the daughter of a wealthy businessman who owns a hotel business, and Fahrin, the brother of a housemaid who works at a villa owned by Sabrina's family. However, despite their strong love, their relationship is buried when Fahrin is imprisoned for a crime he did not commit. From that point on, they are separated. Fahrin is imprisoned on charges of attempted robbery, while Sabrina is married off to Ridhuan, her own cousin, to save her father's failing business. After seven years have passed, their buried love resurfaces when Fahrin and Sabrina meet again unexpectedly under very different circumstances. Sabrina has become a renowned photographer, while Fahrin has emerged as a successful entrepreneur, though the source of his wealth remains a mystery. Ridhuan, disappointed with Sabrina for not giving him her love, returns to his ex-girlfriend Farah, who is also a famous model.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/iPYrqyxc2VxSEEImekuC0hsMq7G.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":119672,"logo_path":null,"name":"Radius One Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Mimpi Sabrina","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":571989,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Juliana Evans","original_name":"Juliana Evans","popularity":0.6059,"profile_path":"/jJqQKfcbkMzESeQW8gMI26EC76W.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a76971948d949ec78c02135","order":0},{"adult